<levels>
1 -1 9.585 0 1 1 0 2 1 1 0 420000 0 1 0 1 0 4.00260325 12.0 2 6 7.16192 7.16192 0 0 0.0 0 5.0 0 0 0

2 1 11.52 0 1 1 0 4 2 1 0 71000 0 1 0 1 0 4.00260325 12.0 2 6 7.16192 7.16192 0 0 0.0 0 5.0 0 0 0

3 -1 11.6 0 1 1 0 6 3 1 0 800000 0 1 0 1 0 4.00260325 12.0 2 6 7.16192 7.16192 0 0 0.0 0 5.0 0 0 0

